    "created_at": "2015-10-20T03:00:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T03:00:21Z",
    "body": "Yeah, this is really just a matter of what the use cases are.  The current spec pretty definitely seems to say that what @domenic reads it to say, though it's a bit weird that calling the methods will change the currentTransform object but mutating the currentTransform object via its mutator methods doesn't obviously update the current transformation matrix....  Not sure whether that's oversight or by-design for some reason.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
