    "body": "I agree that it is strange to think that calling the methods will update the object.\n\nImagine you have two contexts (two canvases).\n\nvar ct1 = ctx1.currentTransform;\nctx2.currentTransform = ct1; // at this point both canvases should have the same transform\nctx2.scale(2, 2); // should this also scale ctx1? I think so, since the ct1 object needs to be updated. Or not? It's weird.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
