    "created_at": "2015-10-20T17:17:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T17:17:16Z",
    "body": "Thinking about this overnight, I'm now pretty much on the side of the fact that currentTransform should be an implicit copy on getting and setting. This has its own weirdness in that ctx.currentTransform != ctx.currentTransform, but I think that might be better than this semi-liveness.\n\nOr have a getCurrentTransform() as Domenic mentioned. This would better match the existing get/setLineDash methods which expose an array (nearly every other property is a String).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
