    "created_at": "2015-10-20T17:25:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T17:25:50Z",
    "body": "Yeah, getCurrentTransform() makes increasing amounts of sense. I think we should just change to that.\n\nAn alternate design that seems possible is that we make currentTransform a DOMMatrixReadOnly, to avoid the problem where mutating currentTransform does not update the context. But in that case we would still want the behavior where mutating the context should update currentTransform.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
